{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "description": "统一账户余额与充值的线上形状黄金向量（dev-board#425）。json 是服务端裸响应原文，expect 是解码后各端应得的值；缺席的可选键必须解成 null，不能是空串或报错（服务端 putIfPresent 对 null 与空串都不出键）。\n\n业务失败一律 HTTP 200 + code:1，判 code 分不出情况；envelope 的 kind 才是**机器可读判别位**，各端一律按 kind 分支——**禁止匹配 message 措辞**（message 经服务端 LangText 在英文部署下会整条变英文，硬编码中文串必然落空），message 只用于兜底展示。code=1 而 kind 缺席的（非 billing 专有的失败）按「读不到」降级，不得当成「没有账户」。\n\nplan 是计费档位（权威侧 lib/wallet.ts 的 getPlan() 只回 paid / free），**不是套餐名，任何一端都不要把它直接渲染给用户**；只有上游没给这个字段时才是 null。\n\nUI 映射（**唯一来源**，四端逐条对齐；要改先改这里再改端）——余额那一行按 kind 分支渲染：\n  NOT_CONNECTED        整行不渲染。不用 balance.notConnected 去解释「为什么没有」：那句话对每一种会触发 NOT_CONNECTED 的服务端条件都给不出有效的补救指引，该键只保留为「需要如实说一句」时的中性表述\n  DISABLED             整行不渲染。本部署没开通这个功能（服务端未配 mobile.billing.* 即此态，也就是四端一发版时的**默认生产状态**），渲染成报错等于给每个用户的设置页永久挂一行「稍后再试」\n  REVIEW_ACCOUNT       整行不渲染。App 审核演示账号一律关掉余额与充值入口，审核员看到的必须是干净的设置页，不是一行报错\n  UNAVAILABLE          显示 balance.unavailable（稍后重试），绝不能显示成没有账户或余额 0\n  NOT_FOUND            显示 balance.unavailable\n  REJECTED             显示 balance.unavailable\n  kind 缺席            显示 balance.unavailable（非 billing 专有的失败走通用 handler），不得当成「没有账户」\n  ALREADY_PAID         与余额无关：只出现在下单/查单路径，走不到余额行\n  IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT 同上\n判据是**这一态会不会自己恢复**：DISABLED / REVIEW_ACCOUNT / NOT_CONNECTED 是永远不会自己变好的终态，把它们渲染成「余额暂时读不到，稍后再试」是让用户去重试一句永不改变的报错；其余才是瞬时故障，值得让用户再试一次（dev-board#425 二轮复审 N2）。\n\n充值入口与余额行（dev-board#535 纠正）：上面那张表是**没有充值能力的端**（capabilities.json 的 recharge 为 false）的规则。**有真实支付通道的端**（recharge = virtual / iap / wxpay-app，当前是小程序的 virtual 与 iOS 的 iap）只改 NOT_CONNECTED 一条：渲染余额行、文案取 balance.notConnected，并**照常显示充值入口**——触发 NOT_CONNECTED 的用户正是还没有统一账户、最该去充值把账户开出来的那批人，把整行连同入口一起藏掉等于让他们在界面上找不到充值口（第二期上线后实测反馈，dev-board#535）。DISABLED / REVIEW_ACCOUNT 仍然整行不渲染、充值入口一并收起（本部署没开通 / 审核演示账号，审核员看到的必须是干净的设置页）。UNAVAILABLE / NOT_FOUND / REJECTED / kind 缺席仍显示 balance.unavailable，而充值入口**保持可见**：读不到余额不代表下不了单，下单失败自会按信封 message 提示。\n\nrecharge = **external** 的端（当前安卓与鸿蒙：还没接通支付通道，入口只弹 recharge.external.title / .body 把人引到小程序）不走上面这套显隐：那不是一个会掏钱的入口，而是一句「这个端还不能充、去哪里充」的说明，**恒显、不依赖余额是否读得到**——入口依赖新用户没有的状态正是 2026-09-09「充值在哪」那起事故本身（docs/MOBILE_DEV_DISCIPLINE.md §1）。余额行本身仍按上面没有充值能力的那套规则渲染。\n\n金额展示口径（display，四端逐字符一致，**不跟随设备 locale**）：符号 + balanceCents/100 固定两位小数、**不带千分位分隔符**。符号按 currency 取：CNY→¥、USD→$；契约当前只有这两种币种，上游要出第三种先扩这张表再改各端，任何一端都不得写死 ¥。iOS 尤其不要用 NumberFormatter(.decimal)：它带千分位且分隔符跟设备语言走，德语设备上 123456 分会显示成「¥1.234,56」，与安卓/小程序的「¥1234.56」对不上（dev-board#425 二轮复审 N7）。fixtures/billing.json 里 balance 每条用例的 display 就是这条规则的期望输出，三端的格式化函数与它对拍；check.mjs 用参考实现复算，夹具不能自说自话。",
  "type": "object", "required": ["balance", "recharge", "status", "envelope"], "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
    "balance": { "type": "array", "minItems": 1, "items": {
      "type": "object", "required": ["name", "json", "expect", "display"], "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "name": { "type": "string" },
        "json": { "type": "object", "required": ["balanceCents", "currency", "plan"], "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": { "balanceCents": { "type": "integer" }, "currency": { "$ref": "#/$defs/currency" },
                          "plan": { "$ref": "#/$defs/plan" }, "billingLine": { "$ref": "#/$defs/billingLine" },
                          "bqtMember": { "type": ["object", "null"] } } },
        "expect": { "type": "object", "required": ["balanceCents", "currency", "plan"], "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": { "balanceCents": { "type": "integer" }, "currency": { "$ref": "#/$defs/currency" },
                          "plan": { "$ref": "#/$defs/plan" }, "billingLine": { "$ref": "#/$defs/billingLine" },
                          "bqtMember": { "type": ["object", "null"] } } },
        "display": { "$comment": "三端金额格式化的期望输出：符号 + 两位小数、无千分位、不跟设备 locale 走。check.mjs 用参考实现复算，端上各自的格式化函数与它对拍",
          "type": "string", "pattern": "^(¥|\\$)[0-9]+\\.[0-9]{2}$" }
      } } },
    "recharge": { "type": "array", "minItems": 1, "items": {
      "type": "object", "required": ["name", "json", "expect"], "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "name": { "type": "string" },
        "json": { "type": "object", "required": ["present", "outTradeNo", "amountCents"], "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": { "present": { "$ref": "#/$defs/present" }, "outTradeNo": { "type": "string" },
                          "amountCents": { "type": "integer", "exclusiveMinimum": 0 },
                          "codeUrl": { "type": "string" }, "qrCode": { "type": "string" }, "redirectUrl": { "type": "string" },
                          "signData": { "type": "string" }, "paySig": { "type": "string" }, "signature": { "type": "string" },
                          "appAccountToken": { "$comment": "present=native 必有：UUID，官网建单时落进 orders.providerRef，端上原样传给 Product.PurchaseOption.appAccountToken——StoreKit 2 只有这一个字段能可靠原样回到 JWS 里，订单与交易全靠它挂钩", "type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}$" } } },
        "expect": { "type": "object",
          "required": ["present", "outTradeNo", "amountCents", "codeUrl", "qrCode", "redirectUrl", "signData", "paySig", "signature", "appAccountToken"], "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": { "present": { "$ref": "#/$defs/present" }, "outTradeNo": { "type": "string" },
                          "amountCents": { "type": "integer", "exclusiveMinimum": 0 },
                          "codeUrl": { "type": ["string", "null"] }, "qrCode": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
                          "redirectUrl": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
                          "signData": { "type": ["string", "null"] }, "paySig": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
                          "signature": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
                          "appAccountToken": { "type": ["string", "null"] } } }
      },
      "allOf": [
        { "$comment": "下面六条把「响应里没有这个键 → 解码结果必须是 null（不是空串）」钉死。signData / paySig / signature 是 present=virtual（微信小程序虚拟支付，dev-board#427）的三件套：signData 必须原样透传给 wx.requestVirtualPayment，端上重新序列化会让签名对不上", "if": { "properties": { "json": { "type": "object", "required": ["codeUrl"] } } },
          "then": { "properties": { "expect": { "type": "object", "properties": { "codeUrl": { "type": "string" } } } } },
          "else": { "properties": { "expect": { "type": "object", "properties": { "codeUrl": { "type": "null" } } } } } },
        { "if": { "properties": { "json": { "type": "object", "required": ["qrCode"] } } },
          "then": { "properties": { "expect": { "type": "object", "properties": { "qrCode": { "type": "string" } } } } },
          "else": { "properties": { "expect": { "type": "object", "properties": { "qrCode": { "type": "null" } } } } } },
        { "if": { "properties": { "json": { "type": "object", "required": ["redirectUrl"] } } },
          "then": { "properties": { "expect": { "type": "object", "properties": { "redirectUrl": { "type": "string" } } } } },
          "else": { "properties": { "expect": { "type": "object", "properties": { "redirectUrl": { "type": "null" } } } } } },
        { "if": { "properties": { "json": { "type": "object", "required": ["signData"] } } },
          "then": { "properties": { "expect": { "type": "object", "properties": { "signData": { "type": "string" } } } } },
          "else": { "properties": { "expect": { "type": "object", "properties": { "signData": { "type": "null" } } } } } },
        { "if": { "properties": { "json": { "type": "object", "required": ["paySig"] } } },
          "then": { "properties": { "expect": { "type": "object", "properties": { "paySig": { "type": "string" } } } } },
          "else": { "properties": { "expect": { "type": "object", "properties": { "paySig": { "type": "null" } } } } } },
        { "if": { "properties": { "json": { "type": "object", "required": ["signature"] } } },
          "then": { "properties": { "expect": { "type": "object", "properties": { "signature": { "type": "string" } } } } },
          "else": { "properties": { "expect": { "type": "object", "properties": { "signature": { "type": "null" } } } } } },
        { "if": { "properties": { "json": { "type": "object", "required": ["appAccountToken"] } } },
          "then": { "properties": { "expect": { "type": "object", "properties": { "appAccountToken": { "type": "string" } } } } },
          "else": { "properties": { "expect": { "type": "object", "properties": { "appAccountToken": { "type": "null" } } } } } },
        { "$comment": "present=virtual 时三件套必须齐全：少任何一个 wx.requestVirtualPayment 都调不起来",
          "if": { "properties": { "json": { "type": "object", "properties": { "present": { "const": "virtual" } }, "required": ["present"] } } },
          "then": { "properties": { "json": { "type": "object", "required": ["signData", "paySig", "signature"] } } } },
        { "$comment": "present=native 时 appAccountToken 必有：没有它 iOS 端拿不到能原样回传的订单挂钩，确认到账时官网无从把 JWS 里的交易认回这笔单",
          "if": { "properties": { "json": { "type": "object", "properties": { "present": { "const": "native" } }, "required": ["present"] } } },
          "then": { "properties": { "json": { "type": "object", "required": ["appAccountToken"] } } } }
      ] } },
    "status": { "type": "array", "minItems": 1, "items": {
      "type": "object", "required": ["name", "json", "expect"], "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "name": { "type": "string" },
        "json": { "$ref": "#/$defs/rechargeStatus" },
        "expect": { "$ref": "#/$defs/rechargeStatus" }
      } } },
    "envelope": { "type": "array", "minItems": 1, "items": {
      "type": "object", "required": ["name", "json", "expect"], "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "name": { "type": "string" },
        "json": { "type": "object", "required": ["code"], "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": { "code": { "type": "integer" }, "message": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
                          "kind": { "$ref": "#/$defs/kind" }, "outTradeNo": { "type": "string" } } },
        "expect": { "type": "object", "required": ["code", "message", "kind", "outTradeNo"], "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": { "code": { "type": "integer" }, "message": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
                          "kind": { "anyOf": [{ "$ref": "#/$defs/kind" }, { "type": "null" }] },
                          "outTradeNo": { "type": ["string", "null"] } } }
      },
      "allOf": [
        { "$comment": "kind 缺席（非 billing 专有的失败走通用 handler）→ 必须解成 null，不能是空串，更不能猜一个出来",
          "if": { "properties": { "json": { "type": "object", "required": ["kind"] } } },
          "then": { "properties": { "expect": { "type": "object", "properties": { "kind": { "$ref": "#/$defs/kind" } } } } },
          "else": { "properties": { "expect": { "type": "object", "properties": { "kind": { "type": "null" } } } } } },
        { "$comment": "outTradeNo 只在 ALREADY_PAID / IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT 时出现",
          "if": { "properties": { "json": { "type": "object", "required": ["outTradeNo"] } } },
          "then": { "properties": {
            "json": { "type": "object", "required": ["kind"], "properties": { "kind": { "enum": ["ALREADY_PAID", "IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT"] } } },
            "expect": { "type": "object", "properties": { "outTradeNo": { "type": "string" } } } } },
          "else": { "properties": { "expect": { "type": "object", "properties": { "outTradeNo": { "type": "null" } } } } } }
      ] } }
  },
  "$defs": {
    "currency": { "enum": ["CNY", "USD"] },
    "present": { "$comment": "virtual = 微信小程序虚拟支付（dev-board#427）：不给二维码也不跳转，端上拿 signData/paySig/signature 调 wx.requestVirtualPayment。\nnative = 端内原生支付通道（当前只有 iOS 内购，dev-board#426）：服务端只建单并给回 appAccountToken，钱走 StoreKit，到账靠端上把 JWS 回传给 POST /api/mobile/billing/recharge/confirm（响应形状与 status 段同一个 RechargeStatus，所以 confirm 不另起夹具段），**服务端确认到账之前绝不能 finish 交易**",
      "enum": ["qrcode", "redirect", "virtual", "native"] },
    "plan": { "$comment": "计费档位，不是套餐名；各端不得直接渲染", "enum": ["paid", "free", null] },
    "billingLine": { "$comment": "计费线，缺席按 standard。bqt = 包晴天律师：四端收起本站充值、订阅购买与后付费还款入口，改显示 bqt.rechargeInBqt——本站充值会被服务端以 bqt_recharge_via_bqt 拒绝，而内购/虚拟支付是先扣钱后到账", "enum": ["standard", "circle", "bqt"] },
    "kind": { "$comment": "与 contract/api/mobile-v1.yaml 的 Envelope.kind 同一套取值；check.mjs 另查夹具是否覆盖全部八个",
      "enum": ["DISABLED", "UNAVAILABLE", "NOT_CONNECTED", "NOT_FOUND", "REJECTED", "REVIEW_ACCOUNT", "ALREADY_PAID", "IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT"] },
    "rechargeStatus": { "type": "object", "required": ["status", "paid", "amountCents"], "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": { "status": { "enum": ["pending", "paid", "closed", "expired"] },
                      "paid": { "type": "boolean" }, "amountCents": { "type": "integer" } } }
  }
}
